                        "Name" : "Nothing happens",
                        "Details" : "Both Darius and [[TGT_MW,{TGT_MW.Callsign}]] are disappointed, but they they sit at one of the smaller tables, pooling their own personal money for a seat. [[SCN_MW,{SCN_MW.Callsign}]] waves goodbye and heads toward the slot machines.\r\n\r\nLater in the evening, Darius drops down into the seat next to you. \"Eight hands out of ten to close out the night. {TGT_MW.Callsign} is a hell of a run. So, yeah\u2026\" He clinks glasses with you. \"We would've made a tidy sum. Not that I'm bitter, of course.\"\r\n\r\nYou grin right back at him. \"Of course you're not. Sometimes you make your own luck.\"",
