                        "Id" : "outcome_1_1",
                        "Name" : "Breaking even",
                        "Details" : "Thanks to [[TGT_MW,{TGT_MW.Callsign}]], breaking even was minor miracle in and of itself. There were a number of notable professionals sitting at that table. Still managing to win four hands out of eight is impressive.\r\n\r\nDarius, of course, questioned everything. Disrupted most of the shady patrons orbiting the table. Throwing accusatory glances at anyone he thought was gaming the system.\r\n\r\nSeeing {TGT_MW.Callsign} staring morosely into {TGT_MW.Det} drink, Darius shakes {TGT_MW.Obj} encouragingly by the shoulders. \"Don't worry about it! At least we broke even, Besides, I hate to toss C-Bills away on a rigged game. Unless I'm the one cheating, of course. And here you are thinking you're unlucky. I told you, it's just all in your mind and tonight proves it. Don't you forget it\"",
