                        "Name" : "Second place",
                        "Details" : "\"I\u2026 don't know this one.\" The color drains from [[TGT_MW,{TGT_MW.Callsign}]]'s face as the rest of the team stares at {TGT_MW.OBJ} expectantly.\r\n\r\n\"Hey, don't worry,\" Darius says as he does some quick math in his head. \"Even if we lose this hand, we still come out on top and take home some good money. Seriously good money. You've been incredible.\"\r\n\r\n[[SCN_MW,{SCN_MW.Callsign}]] chimes in. \"Yeah, don't sweat it. We came in with almost no money and now look?\"\r\n\r\n[[TGT_MW,{TGT_MW.Callsign}]] quietly vows that they will no longer give in to fear and self-doubt.  They have chosen to create their own luck by seizing opportunities whenever they present themselves and letting the chips fall where they may...",
